# Golden: roadmap 9100 feel-genre swing pass — "blues" style, varD (peak
# shuffle, full triplet ride), one held Cmaj7. Locks the engine-driven swing
# (implementer spec docs/proposals/per-style-feel-swing-reauthoring.md): the
# ride's off-8ths now sit on the straight grid (steps 2/6/10/14) and
# groove::apply pushes them late by (480*75)/300 = 120 ticks, landing at
# 600/1560/2520/3480. On-beats (steps 0/4/8/12) stay at exact step*240
# (0/960/1920/2880) — the groove offset is zero there. This golden is the
# regression guard for that feel: any accidental change to blues.hpp's
# .groove or its re-authored ride table would move these ticks and fail this
# test.
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth:4
style load blues
style route drums synth:10
play C
style section varD
transport start
advance 3840
quit
